  "query": "In BigMart sales, the shop needs to allocate various types of products to different display shelves. The capacity of each shelf is provided in \u201ccapacity.csv,\u201d while each product\u2019s value and weight are in \u201cproducts.csv.\u201dThe objective is to maximize the total value of products on all shelves without exceeding any shelf\u2019s capacity. The decision variable  x_{ij} denotes how many units of product \ud835\udc57 are placed on shelf \ud835\udc56.",
